曹贼。今先兴商以裕军资，期与汉室同安天下。 决策理由：建业升商以增金源，支撑联蜀攻魏之军需；接受联军议以固蜀盟、获战斗加成。柴桑城防已固，本回合转图经济。；密谋揭晓：准备守约"},{"id":19214,"turn":2,"type":"joint_attack_proposed","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 向 吴 提议共同进攻 蜀"},{"id":19215,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀接受了 吴 的结盟提议"},{"id":19216,"turn":2,"type":"diplomacy_response","factionId":"wu","message":"吴接受了 蜀 的联合进攻提议"},{"id":19217,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"shu","message":"蜀 将成都建设为农桑专精 1 级"},{"id":19218,"turn":2,"type":"develop_city","factionId":"wu","message":"吴 将建业建设为商贸专精 1 级"},{"id":19219,"turn":2,"type":"transfer","factionId":"wei","message":"魏 从洛阳向宛城调动 7 兵力","payload":{"sourceCityId":"luoyang","targetCityId":"wancheng","troops":7}},{"id":19220,"turn":3,"type":"diplomacy_changed","factionId":null,"message":"蜀 与 吴 的关系变为同盟"},{"id":19221,"turn":3,"type":"turn_prepared","factionId":null,"message":"第 3 回合（蓄势阶段）收入与维持已结算"}],"createdAt":"2026-08-17T16:47:22.666Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-17T16:48:45.575Z","exportedAt":"2026-08-17T16:50:08.443Z"}